    "description": "Miscellaneous crystal geodes and agate mineral specimens lot containing approximately twelve unique pieces. Colors include gray, white, blue, brown, and orange hues. Specimens are partially cut or broken to show inner crystal formations featuring druzy quartz and banded agate layers. Shapes vary from flat polished slices to rounded and irregular forms. All stones are unpolished with natural rough exteriors and surface imperfections typical of mineral specimens. Suitable for collectors, educational use, or display.\nGrab Bag Policy\n\n*Lot may contain other items or sets that are not fully related to contents of grab bag. Examples include: non-branded or off brand versions, similar size items, and/ or small toys mixed in with lot.\n\n*There is no guarantee on rarity or completeness of any sets that may be included in a grab bag. \n\n*Grab bags come as is with no refunds or returns. \n\n* We are unable to answer questions about specific items within a grab bag. Please view the provided photographs to determine general contents.\n\n*Due to the nature of donations used items may have unforeseen damage not noted in the description. \n\n*Some items may come with batteries or other accessories. Unless stated we do not test each part of the item. Some functions may be untested.",
